#: data/io.github.trensoft.cetli.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"cetli keeps short notes in small windows on the GNOME desktop. Every note is "
"one plain file in a folder, so the folder can be kept in step between your "
"computers with a tool such as Syncthing."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.trensoft.cetli.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"If two computers change the same note before they meet, cetli keeps both "
"versions and shows the second one as a note of its own."
msgstr ""

